---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import InnerHero from '../components/InnerHero.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Information — Pending Review"
  description="Privacy information for the LB Elevators website. Final policy is pending business review."
  noindex
>
  <InnerHero
    title="Privacy information"
    crumb="Privacy Policy"
    eyebrow="Website information"
    description="Policy content pending business review and approval."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap legal">
      <p class="note">
        A final privacy policy has not been supplied or approved. This page must
        be reviewed before the public website launches.
      </p>
      <h2>Information you share</h2>
      <p>Our enquiry and quotation forms collect your name, email, phone number, message, consent and the project details you provide. We use these details to respond to your enquiry. Please do not include passwords, financial information or other sensitive data.</p>
      <h2>FormSubmit and Gmail</h2>
      <p>Form submissions are sent through <a href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer">FormSubmit</a> to the personal Gmail address liftsbazar2025@gmail.com, used by LB Elevators. FormSubmit processes the submission as the form-delivery service; Google processes email for Gmail. With JavaScript enabled we also include the source page URL and submission time in India Standard Time.</p>
      <p>FormSubmit's hidden honeypot and service-side filters help reduce spam. If you choose WhatsApp, your enquiry opens in WhatsApp for you to review and send; WhatsApp then processes it under its own terms.</p>
      <h2>Maps</h2>
      <p>Google Maps embeds load only when you select a Load map button. Loading a map or following a Google Maps link connects your browser to Google and is subject to Google’s privacy practices.</p>
      <h2>Retention and requests</h2>
      <p>Contact the business at the email below to ask about access, correction or deletion of your enquiry. The business must confirm its retention period, legal basis, applicable privacy requirements and any international processing arrangements before approving this policy.</p>
      <h2>Questions about your enquiry</h2>
      <p>
        Contact{' '}
        <a class="link-arrow" href="mailto:liftsbazar2025@gmail.com">
          liftsbazar2025@gmail.com
        </a>{' '}
        to discuss the information you share with LB Elevators.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
